WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,920
He is always suspected alone

2
00:00:00,920 --> 00:00:02,960
Turn off the positioning and let him go to school even if he is injured.

3
00:00:02,960 --> 00:00:04,480
Let him choose someone he can trust

4
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,600
At least not for one day

5
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,030
Let him die somewhere no one knows

6
00:00:09,030 --> 00:00:11,150
I'll get it for you

7
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,390
You have a new teammate

8
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:16,930
Does it mean you don’t like me anymore and won’t be gentle?

9
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:18,130
Never liked it

10
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:20,700
It doesn’t matter whether you have teammates or not

11
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:26,300
I'm sad, Wen Chen

12
00:00:26,300 --> 00:00:30,530
sorry

13
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:33,540
Team Liu asked me to apologize to you on behalf of Team 0203.

14
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,200
They say they don't have the face to see you, sorry

15
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,800
We do it in the name of protection

16
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,160
Treat him as the youngest one as a team

17
00:00:41,160 --> 00:00:42,360
It doesn't matter anymore

18
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,600
I'm not gold

19
00:00:43,600 --> 00:00:45,280
Not everyone needs to like it

20
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,960
My biological parents came forward and didn’t like me.

21
00:00:46,960 --> 00:00:48,200
Not to mention strangers

22
00:00:48,200 --> 00:00:49,880
The only one you can rely on is yourself

23
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:52,080
All the suffering in the world can only be overcome by oneself
